  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9dea5f718176a4571a6987",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绽放炫目光芒的“黄金时代”的孩子们。\n夺下主角之位与盾型奖牌的，\n到底会是谁呢──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78e10c68c166cd0dae56ffd06e3235a2217b3e907e1ff7e4ab9ef077feffc3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b846bd131819ac6aeaf28b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（秋）",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd583fd839f6680a57f75e09880ff12f48e50ac7beeab6d01036df8eff7ff5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4220ce03ea8d8ed4a2342b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有兼具支持度与实力的赛马娘\n才能参赛的大舞台……“有马纪念”。\n在那里等待我们的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2207f5de684f80aaab548d5273e4b83ecd4251066791261b06c496a6ad7489e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5973edfa4061fc4808423971",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来自观众的巨大欢呼，\n以及出乎意料的熟人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad5cf9f6d0988d0524764f4fc7bc0662f0d5cfc1ed83e68c1fbd78c2a73a592",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18f56ae732a3b0db86a0bdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“黄金世代”的大集合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c0e9e68194afd53dfe9c908bce23b68ea742937e19af39028c24de22fb9201",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1272ca851d9217603f5e3fb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环一边叹气，\n一边重新振作精神，\n打算让全部人都帮她伴舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455286c4d7d5a468f44eb8fb5adfb5b31ae5545397fa38214bc5affc49735606",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff7c01ce9e5cf0709ae25282",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46296155669780c9b1771c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环跑完出道战后，\n虽然气喘吁吁，疲惫不堪，\n仍为自己今后能以职业身份活跃而开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41d85e7b92275d7722658db4820a19cd6a7207779f2591f948e4cbc1bba39e65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9295fdef8495c34aca4933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但圣王光环的母亲却打了电话过来，\n对她的出道表达否定的态度。\n从这件事……看得出两人之间的鸿沟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e77156861d128fe934efb7dc71c5f53eb2c1f4832d54a25c1b101775f8b11f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d252055f56eb6c01e2ed1f64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了给什么都不懂的母亲好看，\n圣王光环宣告下个目标是GⅠ赛事──\n“希望锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d198722acaf942d43bc39426bf860c5932e40dce20d43f9d4d0d327049b5c530",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1147fede18e77588a6d1607c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・一通电话",
      "source_fingerprint": "815949df1fccc90c049f08a94db4652806b57f9010d35a3782167fdaf787bf4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93eacb2590e435e86b6bcae0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环在ＧⅠ赛事“希望锦标”上，\n留下了足够出色的成绩，\n她宣布将直接前进经典三冠路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fe141b6c5c6216289b9470a9c45bf7019f3be7314c3c71368ca8f18ba33479b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4328fee1f436e3b423bc96e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是一生只能挑战一次的梦幻舞台……\n挑战“皋月赏”、“日本德比”与“菊花赏”，\n可说是无比激烈的比赛路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b0f1f1e0c5d07b7c98d069ce39013aa7fbe83b43070b0aea24ac3c1272ec40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b9517b139de8a8e380e283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，圣王光环将下一场目标定为\n三冠的首战──“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa7dda09ee2db9af8f85f9e204737de41c975146eceb6e6ce5bdb26d65477aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2318b563b63693b86776beb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望S结束后・前进的决心",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2e84cb4ba1a79573a284387b06cf395841bfd2c81bfc1d0584d47500f392f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db1da4af566f3b0583af618",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环在经典三冠路线的首战，\n“皋月赏”中漂亮地拿下了第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2723084fa27c06ad35625c607202932c1e3182f704fd04a03a7d6beffab20333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae9b7c17407611f78b57e9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“不愧是那个人的千金！”……\n背负着粉丝们充满期待的话语，\n圣王光环深自确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7114ce3b58ce65c56cb89ced796584a3321a1283b35de99efe90bea4028e80bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e80c309f8703e6033e56333",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要照这样下去，在受众人憧憬的舞台\n“日本德比”也能得到第一名。\n如此一来──应该就能受到认可才是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ad780c3dbffe62232b7f008b9deec36da91f5c9ddfb86314ea74cdd38ac57b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b10fd636913304f09dd0f1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・千金的一冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "1748465e3085fcc8b14001a3ddc01cae5e397a49b639690db762502a8290149e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5945c063b7ea5457122b2795",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──亏她还是传说赛马娘的“千金”……\n在中山赛场，来看圣王光环表现的观众们\n发出了失望的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f97a2e070bd9bf4752bddb2b3f2f653d22a00737a6d29a2b42ce49bec3771dae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab2a104620175ed4d445a71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但圣王光环不会放弃。\n她发誓，在下一个目标……“日本德比”，\n一定会取得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e0aa50e0ce5d6cde8b3824909c3f9f8ed50704686b00e9c842528456c06776",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7556dbe225639b0e1a58fc4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当晚，圣王光环回到学园时，\n在校门口碰到了特别周，并听她诉说\n想为了母亲在“日本德比”获胜的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148ea654793dfbac4660ef53fa7bec296e1c1b1a40650477700b3545ac7b2833",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c97199c7648298867a607a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看着友人在母亲的鼓励下努力的身影，\n圣王光环也开始了耐力跑训练。\n“我也有不能拱手让人的胜利。”她如此说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4440b1e94ef8c856587e5db37a28f7d24d7c3f937b208e0141d12efb86c3f79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a42433558c91e93aa8b8f6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・赞赏的方向",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f0202a191e402e1294f68ee7c117406da761c3f462fc393b8b4b1f72c8d7928",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16ef7cd1d7dbfb6870ca9f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环称霸了“日本德比”。\n她只在优胜者区域高声大笑了一会儿，\n就从采访记者面前消失了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9bac73e11072190ce68b8b838d7be935e9f3becd0720f5da0c2d1d0d3736aed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb3c9c2930885f8b3bb2abe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这是为了引开采访记者，\n让他们别去注意\n战败后留下不甘泪水的特别周。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef795e6584d4ed7d763a247f3a0b16af9497b37a0e40f0bdc44a8ee7cfe2544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315de747860e37496ad9eb7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，电话响起。是圣王光环的母亲。\n她在电话中赞美特别周的表现，\n并责备圣王光环胜利后的举止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03196c527054784540aaf3a745c06176652643079855019856bfa60b0057cf4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:785430ad5d092cbdb14fd889",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然还无法得到认可的话……\n圣王光环发誓，在经典三冠路线\n最后的比赛“菊花赏”也要留下结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32dd3359e22da762db9caa9a2d40f911ce50c9dcba6e062df84de96491ce5f4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e1cb1f7e8eee363ec868d19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・映入眼瞳的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0760c4ceb5dc43d669c2f43dd02d333ed6e0d23c5b8a5adb0b10b9a5b035a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb5116c08d2d5c7370e117b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无法在“日本德比”得到第一名，\n圣王光环强忍悔恨陷入沮丧。\n虽然她在训练员面前表现得很坚强──",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b7fa20c895ed2901102d7b15df142541876f452e37a586bf517150dba69979",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a24cf0d701b190888fed91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但此时她的母亲打了电话来，\n并在电话中一边称赞特别周的表现，\n另一边又劝圣王光环“放弃”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cd116ee09359c149243fa1580a472525dfa2b15f65c6984ac624d82f70458f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23656e3365011e9f5db02031",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我建议你在出更多洋相前，赶快回来吧。”\n对母亲的这句话，\n圣王光环眼眶含泪地发誓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73215997cb8a832da3954b554ec6556b05f7f6ce59f7e928a3395ab27da90b7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82478376193cb1ec5ec7ad9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经典三冠路线的最终战“菊花赏”上，\n她一定会获胜，不会把第一名让给任何人。\n因为自己是──应该要得到认可的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685a74444d1a2b347a3972de9499b6b415c5cdf1432005faaba68a7a43bf055a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb1d97056c4a2d9c0a7116b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・是谁错失机会",
      "source_fingerprint": "b90301bf800a92c462d8f2b19023e12f91bdd363818f12b89187cb552e3c9b15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b171b497af83d700ee95618",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠最后的舞台“菊花赏”。\n得到第一名的圣王光环\n难掩兴奋地打电话给她的母亲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1811053bb71dfc6994bd9989f06e299f628bfbbd66ee4e2049c6d2abfbe370a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e2fde27a8ad68ec187b3a2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次她一定会肯定自己吧──\n但来自母亲的言语却只有表面工夫，\n并未真心认可她的女儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54be33d74bff34462ecf22373ccadcb904b917cfcbeffd92c821606c6e074a0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a16e4cc3e64a8245af78ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众与工作人员的欢呼声，\n也都只有“不愧是那位母亲的千金”。\n与期望不同的现实，令圣王光环感到苦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d327cab2459aef77660bc3a8ddc1b5ece63ebf9ff8d2232d810deebf8ae3d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcde06842a76f2aef1fe0143",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第二天，圣王光环询问训练员\n有没有舍弃一切的决心，\n这是她自己经过彻底思考后的决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cf0873d39111023710be804b6d668b83bd4793ca443b4b1f4736eb8e013f07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31304605559b64bd49ab848a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・得到的话语是",
      "source_fingerprint": "131813a8f12cc183e8ffda9787fd1977633482cf282916760aea80b479901745",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2f5a9b74d9916b59cc622f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”结束了。\n所有的欢呼声都在赞美青云天空与特别周。\n圣王光环亲眼看到了现实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41a7abe68da5683828153896f6026ddea51154a2be7cebbcebcd9bac2a99929",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b888e32cb4aec26675d72059",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“得不到认同了。”“自己并不是一流。”\n圣王光环无力地吐出丧气话。而鼓励她的人，\n是川上公主等数名赛马娘，以及──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc3bc94ef6ff07b31d57292b7a30cad7fcacec6377d585a520bbeb59881fd27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f0d1515ed4d973fbf6591f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一直看着她的训练员。\n圣王光环把脸埋在训练员的肩上。\n只要一下下就好，到眼泪停下为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a021acd81b04dd2f1022fac816140e00dbd68d67ccec612c3aaae835c30f4940",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:283d75c577ae2d74da307ee0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后在训练员的鼓励下，\n她开始以“只属于自己的一流”为目标，\n走上不是只为“受到认可”的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f256c3e93d2db2f65c10f376636db0f10b87a01e74607417c3063325b18d7777",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3d4298453332960cb056386",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・现实是",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ace3682a4c33673c439cc5597a611a793a08f273c14eb8406b8b28fef0a73b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31d1d0bdf606dc8a8afa769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在盛大欢呼声包围下，圣王光环慰劳训练员，\n……两人一起细细品味着胜利的滋味。\n同时也替成功展现自己的才能而感到高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "833a8bdb9876ca52b747eb60a5ac411dd8165c2daf5e3283a271abae02703dcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3783c71bd45161efd1b78ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，圣王光环回到了休息室，\n川上公主兴奋地对她说，\n她总有一天也会在“高松宫纪念”获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8fa9457cd9c5b70b99a49ce7e64b860d8c74f95a2430eecc119652fa9bc523",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd16ee9f175e6ded02611b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这句话让圣王光环想起了以前的自己。\n“你就在你自己的目标上成为一流吧。”\n她如此回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe92759da7a9999968b8a00a4ecab2a7b7bd3b85d6cf9040749bcba76cbafed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a49591b2823a9fc024564fbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后她将下个目标定为“安田纪念”，\n“毕竟我们的能力可不只这点程度。”\n说完，圣王光环露出自信的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29e86ec4dfacfac376b43e2a50ee6a2d088b99c6d10a71c6cf428646cba9f394",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d05ac44af5d02d923d12ccd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高松宫纪念结束后・才能的证明",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ed42703d911183a648ca335ce7ac23f8c045a9dd346d5ed13a330da252c59c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8044e7bd96a2640b904cb0bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“安田纪念”跑出漂亮的名次后，\n圣王光环得到观众们的声援。\n大家已经完全迷上“圣王”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6824ddc67fb98196661363d3e933940c1fc315609818f0469dcb681e3ff1044c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f59fdc2e80accc04e01c44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环在短距离上的才能\n开始开花结果，让她走上了\n符合她本性的“一流赛马娘”之路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8a669f5f6965d2d306c5b6cae53cc4b47db1a3d8f07ff53206561927782e9a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54bb247623e1f3703b9fb88b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她笑着与粉丝们互动，\n并发表接下来将前进秋季GⅠ赛事\n“短途马锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "868eabc7f5e54d97315117ffe396e243740f7e2cc797d2732444ebb1ed37f604",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ea6764b1b770d28cf5958d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "安田纪念结束后・呼唤我的名字",
      "source_fingerprint": "69748b03a17a0dfe6f0e8e02a95d93f163afa4f0c868360806381a0de8ee1570",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f01c3593bd08934d2491d16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“短距离的新英雌・圣王光环”\n“明年也会称霸春秋两场大赛！？”……当她在\n休息室满足地看着新闻快报时，手机响了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf661932b651768a35da4eaca6d70a49a1fddd66dc2ded09370957664887b94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c8c648f99b9f2b376c927a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是圣王光环的母亲打来的。\n她询问下一场是否也要走短距离、英里路线。\n圣王光环的回答则是“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde9a04e3ccdfd70b9e92dfc0e3f13e010170bf08155ba3e12a805e5a07a0ff2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c471e832285318fee3ba144d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲虽对又要挑战新舞台的女儿感到傻眼，\n却也说了“你就去努力取胜吧。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "2afca33e61899aee450760562a39cbf1cf69073075b40f1cbfb0ff8179985b93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abb8a276780eb43b9974fa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这与至今的“快回家”不同，\n是为要出赛的赛马娘送行的话语。\n圣王光环笑道：“现在才说也太晚了吧。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b0cb61ece24a5c69ecc2604902b0de7c8f7a9ec9480c50f0a4e52c0fd95e6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ba2e8cac4d5b6e6ba1ec91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短途马S结束后・王者之道",
      "source_fingerprint": "477072bf1a423f6ba2b8e8db599105b3abdee4ae147f473ec2f10e40a54d0421",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf330e2394a0cac88167c39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”的胜负已定。\n圣王光环闭上眼睛，享受着欢呼声的包围。\n然后她前往了某个地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5dfc484b81443be25ce0e7775ed0801a60a74994afae9ecff1cbb42495f6286",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953bb3af198291b8c3dbbf13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是去找在这场激战中，\n和自己激烈交锋过的特别周\n以及青云天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2255956f4f96ab8c5bd2e209c36632a603b24768ec98bf127033f471699cb13b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa605c3992d9b62846f6cd25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "憎恨、懊悔……与感谢。\n她们互相倾诉存在于内心深处的思绪，\n并一起笑着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "737319cde89ce475fb9ed000e4f3d5f12abec02117de4b4c90a03310ac94042d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa7e7ca8b9b60521e29782d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们之间吹起了一股不断前进的风。\n她们的比赛还会继续吧。\n因为她们是劲敌──是同期的选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a733d86a6e44541b52460e83522eec1d1d0ec01d549242badf6ee910e3ee7f17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa72c9da3974b9242489969",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・一流的竞争对手",
      "source_fingerprint": "480ff1afc5d627c8a150d5de7f954c1ef3c32769f7148b2720e6d18843e5de46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a664373c43d66b9cd7e557f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顺利在“有马纪念”获得第一名，\n拿下今年最后的主角之位的──\n是一流赛马娘，圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e89a92b8f80db42d3b49961c97c988ea43d85e07a5b0563ff2e33b926f09c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c506d57ba19ec0ce695d99cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜者舞台开始在即，\n这时她的母亲打电话过来，\n但圣王光环已经不会慌张了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ec36cf41af819fd422249c8a6eb265b07139518a03701a848f63182a59b299",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0abedc654b77bf08ece20fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔着电话，她宣告自己会超越母亲，\n并说：“我迟早会让世人称呼你为\n‘圣王光环的母亲’。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf033658473a83bc31ecdd0fb2b92466665680fe6833e431030c3eaf3b2b93a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a3dc25459b04bb44b0fc56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把手机交给训练员保管后，她便跑了出去。\n“不擅沟通的女儿与不擅沟通的母亲。”\n听了她们刚才的对话后，训练员如是想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7041c145d72f7874d64cf77681d6365294b33b19c9c8f5a86c716e695be8fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac4573ad52e41f9c4114cb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・有圣王必有",
      "source_fingerprint": "418e3c3b67d44582010fcff5c02ff0d7ac4587542d5c4da97708c2271cd6be98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aee441781c8905254a88059",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然错失第一名令圣王光环十分懊恼，\n但她仍然和青云天空一起，\n前往演唱会舞台准备参与演出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b987404091fb46c17f48ebd55ad90fd756986ff7d1d8169bcd07518a56b46f80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c0ba3aca171149a8600cce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然“有马纪念”是今年最后的比赛，\n那这就是今年最后一次，\n向粉丝传达感谢的机会了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "634b42a7095a9519a87a8bd01e050f83fa6cea084fd31659d05c26e5b8762054",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efc2850decb3d34dd54a328",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们的胜者舞台，\n让大家见识到了今年最为火热的盛况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd55353cea830d16da0ee90639a2b37e66320434522ac389f58268b3c7b9872f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e6691a80d0c298f81b4857",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・伴随着感谢及誓言",
      "source_fingerprint": "233117243de24615a3659d1553cd291cc4a32d0971807efa2611207345af8bf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1061/storytimeline_501061431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
